OL,3,AHouthi missile attack on Yemeni
OL,4,Apresidential palace kills five,
OL,5,Aminister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive people have been killed and 16
OL,8,Finjured in a Houthi missile attack
OL,9,Ftargeting the presidential palace in
OL,10,Fthe port city of Aden in southern
OL,11,FYemen, which is the seat of the
OL,12,Finternationally-recognised government,
OL,13,Fofficials say.
OL,15,FInformation Minister Moammar al-Eryani
OL,16,Ftold the BBC that the prime minister
OL,17,Fand other ministers were unhurt when
OL,18,Ffive ballistic missiles hit al-Maashiq
OL,19,FPalace.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
