OL,3,AHouthi missile attack on Yemeni
OL,4,Apresidential palace kills five,
OL,5,Aminister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Houthis' military spokesman, Yahya
OL,8,FSarea, said they struck "the Saudi
OL,9,Fenemy's military operations
OL,10,Fheadquarters in Aden".
OL,12,FA coalition led by Saudi Arabia backs
OL,13,Fthe government and is providing air
OL,14,Fsupport for an offensive by
OL,15,Fpro-government forces against the
OL,16,FIran-backed Houthis.
